      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JUST A MENACE (1) has mixed form recently, finishing fourth (35.58) in a Grade 5 at this track latest but did run well two back when in the frame. Meets a moderate line up and rates on top this time. CANYA REDLINE (4) copped a check in the run and finished a well held 10 lengths fifth (30.49) last time in a Grade 4/5 at this track over 520m. Gets chance to atone. WYONG IRVING (6) failed to feature last start at this track, but prior to that won comfortably by 3.5 lengths at Northam (29.80) beating Oliver Grande in a Grade 4/5 on August 17. Worth another chance. TOMMY THE LION (2) missed the placings here last start but is well-placed to bounce back.",
